        "original_id": "327ab28d-0918-56f2-be1d-2dce31c28008",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Stoke City F.C., Bet365 Group Ltd\n- Products: away kit, special crest\n- Events: 2012–13 Stoke City F.C. season, club 150th year anniversary\n- Topics: shirt sponsorship, club branding\n\nFacts:\n- During the 2012–13 Stoke City F.C. season, Stoke City F.C. marked its 150th year in existence with a special crest.\n- During the 2012–13 Stoke City F.C. season, Stoke City F.C.'s away kit used the navy and cardinal colors worn by Stoke Ramblers in 1863.\n- During the 2012–13 Stoke City F.C. season, Bet365 became Stoke City F.C.'s new shirt sponsor, replacing Britannia.\n- Bet365 Group Ltd, styled as bet365, is a gambling company based in the United Kingdom.",
